      "sourceLabels": [
        "Web source 1"
      ],
      "source": "https://grokipedia.com/page/patch_grove_wisconsin"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Patch Grove is located within the Driftless Region, an area once used as hunting grounds by the Ho-Chunk, Sauk, and Fox tribes.",
